            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-17T20:54:53.402021+00:00",
            "notes": "By this round you should have enough cash to buy [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)[El-Sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100), if not just buy other WP to kill people. Avoid people that kill you easily and BULLY the ones that cant.\n\nAt worst just be an annoying menace and help your team win by distracting 1-3 people from the fight.\n\nAs for the power, if they have a lot of projectiles on their team i go for [Bullet Time](item_6840382c-ae92-491a-b70c-b49f3a76003a), if not then [Blink of an Eye](item_c1f6466f-b2ac-4b6a-ba48-b1531dfd686f) gives me more uptime during a fight.",
