            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-17T20:54:53.402021+00:00",
            "notes": "Here, you're lethal enough to oneclip all squishes, BUT if you're broke then get [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448), and even if thats too much [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) would do fine. You should be able to tank some damage so dont be scared and recall instantly, and always break their ankles buy blinking and shooting some bullets by activating 2 Powers, [Foresight](item_f4163ce1-8f80-43ca-85d4-39812084400f) and [Timelapse](item_20d43db5-d2ad-47e9-b32f-82d8eca006ce), and [El-Sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) will help you close the deal.",
