            "created_at": "2025-09-17T20:54:53.402021+00:00",
            "notes": "Now, finally, you are the ultimate unkillable menace. Just do as you were and you'll be fine. \n\nAs for the Power, i personally like [Bullet Time](item_6840382c-ae92-491a-b70c-b49f3a76003a) or [Blink of an Eye](item_c1f6466f-b2ac-4b6a-ba48-b1531dfd686f) here but i've seen people make [T.Racer](item_996e13d5-9521-4312-944f-d672f528776b) work so if you like it then get it.\n\nIf you can do the full build just get a rare instead of one epic, NOT [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce)[El-Sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100) These are IMPORTANT",
